        "TileImage": "$($repository 3ed1c7e6-7707-48b4-a0f0-b933bc851fdb).Image",
        "Description": "When the ICA was founded long ago, there was once an agent by the name of Sinclair. Agent Sinclair was known for his kills that often used fire.\r\rIn today&apos;s contract, we thought you&apos;d honor him. You are required to kill these targets with an explosion accident, a fire accident and and a LOUD explosive device. However, which method you assign to which target is your choice. You should pick an appropriate suit that you think Sinclair would have worn.\r\r-1 explosion acc\r-1 fire acc\r-1 explosive",
